   ],
   "px": [
    20
   ],
   "chars": 160,
   "text": "This is not a brand-by-brand problem. It surfaces signals of a deeper current running through global consumer culture. Five tensions – observable across markets"
  },
  {
   "kind": "sp",
   "name": "Text 3",
   "box": [
